on and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Words that start with <span class-\"italic\">im-</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you use <span class=\"italic\">im-</span> at the beginning of a word, the second syllable is stressed.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Read these words out loud. Concentrate on the pronunciation. Stress the second syllable. <br /><br />  im<span class=\"strong\">pos</span>sible<br /> im<span class=\"strong\">press</span>ive <br /> im<span class=\"strong\">por</span>tant<br /> im<span class=\"strong\">pressed</span><br /> im<span class=\"strong\">med</span>iately<br /> im<span class=\"strong\">mens</span>ely<br />", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It's impossible to stay seated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The shopping will be impressive. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Is it important to wear the colors?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He'll be impressed if we do that.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I don't know if I'll understand the rules immediately.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Peter is going to be immensely happy.<br/> <br/>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Silent Syllables With Unstressed Vowels", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Most words contain a syllable that is unstressed. Dif<span class=\"italic\">fer</span>ent is an example.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " Read these words  with unstressed syllables out loud. Concentrate on the pronunciation. <br /><br /> probably &rarr; (prob_ly)<br /> different &rarr; (diff_rent)<br /> everyone &rarr; (ev_ryone)<br /> comfortable &rarr; (comf_ tuble)<br /> Wednesday &rarr; (Wens_day) <br />           Note that the 'd' in Wednesday is also silent!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Peter <span class=\"strong\">probably</span> has a team jersey.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This is going to be a <span class=\"strong\">different</span> experience.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Doesn't <span class=\"strong\">everyone</span> stand up at the beginning of the game to sing the national anthem?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Doesn't it make sense to wear <span class=\"strong\">comfortable</span> sneakers?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We got tickets to <span class=\"strong\">Wednesday's</span> game!", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "team spirit ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an exciting feeling or attitude to work or play with a group of people as a team", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  It is impressive how the people who show team spirit encourage the football players to do their best.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear/use when you talk about sports.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "clover ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small plant that usually has  three round leaves", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am a lucky guy! Although it is almost impossible to find a four-leaved clover, I found one yesterday!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "national anthem ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the official song of a country", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was impressed by the audience's respectful attitude towards the national anthem. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to make sense ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be practical and reasonable", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It makes sense to wear comfortable sneakers when walking for long distances.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "boundaries", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a limit that is traced to show the end and beginning of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The farm's boundary is marked by a tree line. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "immensely ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to a great extent", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Last week, he was immensely worried because he had lost his wallet. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to unfold ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to develop", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We'll understand better as the drama unfolds. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "logo", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the image or symbol that represents an institution, a team, a company, etc. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The team's logo is a blue bird. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le13ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "You have bought tickets for you and a friend to go to a game.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue asking your friend to go with you to the game.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use negative questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try to use one or two words that start with <span class=\"italic\">im-</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud with a partner and practice pronunciation.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I invite a friend to a game.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use negative questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say words with <span class=\"italic\">im-</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud paying careful attention to pronunciation.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le13ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le13ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can't wait to go to Boston! The shopping will be impressive and we get to see a live basketball game. What's the team called?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The Boston Celtics. Don't they wear bright green, not dark green?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't know! I've never been to a basketball game. Is it important to wear the colors?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes. It's traditional to show team spirit, don't you think? Peter probably has a team jersey and we can paint green clovers on our faces. He'll be impressed if we do that.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Why clovers?"}, {"image": "engenn8le13ob04re2img02.jpg", "time": "32300", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's the team logo.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This is going to be a different experience! Doesn't everyone stand up at the beginning of the game to sing the national anthem?\n<br /><sp